{title: Daru Badnam}
{artist: Kamal Kahlon}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D],        Ni lakh tera patla jeha
[Em],        jdo tur di sitara bal khave
[D],        morni ji tor kudiye
[Em],        hun mundiya to hosh kitho aave
[Bm],        ni naagni di maankh waaliye
[C],        ni naagni di aankh waaliye
[D] [Em],        sab kite tu gabru kanware ooh
[D],        O daaru badnaam krti
[Em],        ae ta naina terya de kaare...
[D],        O daaru badnaam krti
[Em],        ae ta naina terya de kaare...
[D],        O daaru badnaam krti
[Em],        ae ta naina terya de kaare...
[D],        o thekeya de raah bhool gye
[Em],        jdo tak le sharabi nain tere
[D],        naina cho dhul phle todti
[Em],        gal vas ch rhi na hun mere
[Bm],        ooh bina dat khole kudiye
[C],        ooh bina dat khole kudiye
[D] [E],        tenu peen firn ethe saare mooo
[D],        O daaru badnaam krti
[Em],        ae ta naina terya de kaare...
[D],        O daaru badnaam krti
[Em],        ae ta naina terya de kaare...
[D],        O daaru badnaam krti
[Em],        ae ta naina terya de kaare...
[D],        O pta kro kede pind di
[Em],        kudi gidhe ch karayi att jave
[D],        O pta kro kede pind di
[Em],        kudi gidhe ch karayi att jave
[D],        O dj da kasoor koi na
[Em],        kudi chobran te sine aag lave
[D],        O dj da kasoor koi na
[Em],        kudi chobran te sine aag lave
[Bm],        Tu dilan ute kahar krdi
[C],        Tu dilan ute kahar krdi
[D] [Em],        jag jind jaan tere ute ware mooo
